From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: laudney <106273+laudney@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 01:47:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 21/34] fix(cache): retain exact image identities in prompt
 states

Upstream TensorFold commit by laudney, ported onto this series (upstream main 1db545bd645e).

Keep image prefix identities and family frames beside cache words
so colliding one-row images cannot resume each other's state.

(cherry picked from commit 1db545bd6)

Adapted in this series: our Store keeps its own fields (live pins, keeping, anchors, share chains) and its
share-aware byte count; the image identities and frame are added beside them. keepAnchor and shared-row
entries carry no image identity, so an image prompt never resumes one (they are refused, not mixed up).
